description	"Tobias Beckett

An adaptable gunslinger with a wide skillset.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Beckett's Arsenal
-- Mando Pistols (3)
-- 15% more FP damage/Damage
-- 15% Faster RoF
-- 15% More Velocity
-- Low Ammo, Mag Reload
- Frag Grenades (2)
-- Cripples/Tracks On Hit
- Smuggler A280-CFE Rifle
-- Projectile Rifle
-- 75% Less Damage/FP Drain
-- 60% Faster RoF
-- 60% Faster Velocity
-- 15 Round Clip
- E-11 Blaster Rifle (2)
-- Tracks, 50% Less Damage
-- Mag Reload

^6Inventory:
- Medpac ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Healing (2)
- Grapple Hop
- Bunny Hop (0)
- 25% Faster Hack Rate
- 10% Faster Cooldowns
- Tracking Beacon
- Knockdown Roll
- Anti MT (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]
- Combat Roll ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4 Melee]
- Disguise (1) ^3[Change Style In MELEE]"